                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4125' id='24' type-v2='text' w='94286' x='2857' y='95375'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Created By: Marcelo Rodriguez</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>
Please direct all inquiries to the People Analytics JIRA
</run>
                  <run auto-url='true' fontalignment='1' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/plugins/servlet/desk/portal/53&amp;quot;'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/plugins/servlet/desk/portal/53</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='1875' id='202' type-v2='empty' w='94286' x='2857' y='93500'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='86062' id='283' type-v2='text' w='94286' x='2857' y='7438'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Purpose</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>This dashboard is designed to measure Workforce and Demographic metrics combining data from Workday and Bamboo systems. Since Field Ops employees stored in Bamboo have limited amount of data compared to those in Workday, the following fields are completed manually with the value &quot;Field Ops&quot;: Company, Cost Center, Job Family, Job Family Group, Level, Supervisory Org and Manager Chain.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Since Store Managers are present in both systems, they are being filtered out from Bamboo using the &quot;Mağaza Müdürü&quot; Business Title.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Definitions</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># HC Actual</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Amount of active employees during a specific time frame.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Starters</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Amount of new joiners calculated by their First Day of Work.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Terminations Effective</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Number of employees whose last day of work already took place</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>% Attrition</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Proportion of employees who have left the company over a specific time frame calculated monthly by the sum of # Terminations Effective and divided by the # HC Actual of that same month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>% Attrition YTD</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Acumulative % Attrition per year.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Avg Promotion Speed (m)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Average of months from the last promotion to the previous promotion date or hire date to promotion date.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># M-level</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Amount of active employees within the &quot;M&quot; management levels (M1 to M6).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># IC-level</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Amount of active employees within the &quot;IC&quot; management levels (IC1 to IC6).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># S-level</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Amount of active employees within the &quot;S&quot; management levels (S1 to S4).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Field Ops</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Amount of active employees within Bamboo system + Store Supervisors in Workday (identified through the Banabi store locations).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Avg Age (y)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Average age of the active employees expressed in years.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Avg Tenure (y)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Average tenure of the active employees expressed in years.Insert definition.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Female</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Amount of active female employees during a specific time frame.Insert definition.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>% Female</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='11'>Proportion of active female employees vs overall amount of employees.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
